--- /dev/null
+++ b/.temp/TASK-260830-17suox/TASK-260830-17suox_results.md
@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@
+# TASK-260830-17suox implementation evidence
+
+## Delivered scope
+
+- Exact closed TOML readers for Configuration 1.0.0, 2.0.0, and 3.0.0.
+- In-memory v1/v2 translation to the current v3 model, including deterministic `tmux`/`conpty` backend mapping without rewriting source bytes.
+- Current-only Configuration 3.0.0 writer with read-back validation.
+- Production `Load` wiring, immutable returned snapshots, safe rendered decode errors, and caller-supplied exact backend settings validation.
+- Pinned-catalog-derived reader completeness, positive/negative compatibility fixtures, boundary matrices, security refusals, round trips, README/tool documentation, and scoped traceability.
+- No atomic config-file migration, downgrade mutation, doctor surface, or runtime capability claim was added; those remain outside this leaf scope.
+
+## Accepted validation
+
+| Command | Exit | Result |
+| --- | ---: | --- |
+| `go test ./internal/config -cover -count=1` | 0 | 83.9% statement coverage |
+| `go test ./... -v` | 0 | All repository tests passed |
+| `go test ./... -cover -count=1` | 0 | All package coverage runs passed |
+| `go vet ./...` | 0 | Clean |
+| `go build ./...` | 0 | Build passed |
+| assigned Section 3.2/6.1-6.5/17.1/17.2/17.5 tracecheck | 0 | 60 contracts, 32 acceptance cases, 9 assigned scopes |
+| `go mod verify` | 0 | All modules verified |
+| `git diff --check` | 0 | Clean |
+
+## Expected-red mutation attacks
+
+Each temporary mutant was run with `-count=1`, returned exit 1, and was restored before the accepted gates:
+
+- strict unknown-field decoding disabled;
+- current-version dispatch narrowed away from pinned 3.0.0;
+- SSH host-authentication bypass refusal disabled;
+- service health upper bound widened by one;
+- capability sorted/closed registry enforcement disabled;
+- duplicate external backend trust refusal disabled;
+- missing backend settings registry refusal disabled;
+- runtime-platform equality gate disabled;
+- legacy `tmux -> ax.tmux` translation corrupted.
+
+The evidence archive contains accepted green logs, the earlier stale-count red full-suite logs and their green reruns, and every expected-red mutant log.
+
+## Non-obvious decisions
+
+- Omitted v3 `required_capabilities` remains distinguishable from an explicit empty array so the contextual "platform lane minimum" default is not invented by this package.
+- `backend_config.settings` is accepted only through an exact caller-provided validator for the backend ID/config version; absent registry state is an error, never an empty/default settings schema.
+- Durable backup/fsync/atomic replacement is intentionally not implemented here because it belongs to sibling task `TASK-260830-1qf777`.
+
